WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
Punjab, around the year 1500.

2
00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:08.090
Muslim sultans rule from Delhi,
over a mostly Hindu population.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:12.790
In 1469, in the village of
Talwandi, Nanak is born.

4
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.700
He grows up among Hindus and Muslims.

5
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.520
In his world, Sufi mystics seek
God through poetry and music.

6
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:25.260
Poet-saints like Kabir, a
weaver, have sung against caste.

7
00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:30.430
So when Guru Nanak began to teach, how
much of his message was really new?

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.710
In this mission, you'll map
the world he grew up in:

9
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.870
rulers, Sufis, and the sant poets.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.540
Then you'll weigh up how
believers and historians answer,

11
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.850
from revelation to borrowing.

12
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:47.070
Your mission: weigh up how much
of Guru Nanak's message was new.
